  "phase_method": "Opt-in wall-clock subdivisions: load includes support-file read and workspace load or C source read; check covers the verified workspace compile; emit_support covers authority check, C emission and support assembly; msvc_build covers C compile, link and artifact read; exe_write covers final file write. Phases exclude harness startup, workspace setup, warm toolchain discovery and program execution.",
